    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-09-18",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Protecting Free Vaccines Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires Medicare, Medicaid, the Children's Health Insurance Program (CHIP), and private health insurers to cover, without cost-sharing, vaccines that were recommended by the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention's Advisory Committee on Immunization Practices as of October 25, 2024. The requirement ends on January 1, 2030.</p>",
        "update_date": "2026-03-20T19:20:44Z"
      }
    ]
  },
